Geometry under data/geo/ is licensed per source, file by file.

Natural Earth (land-present.json, regions.json)
  Public domain. Natural Earth is made with the participation of volunteers
  and is free of any licence restrictions in any way.
  https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/
  Files derived from Natural Earth 1:110m vector data, version 5.1.2, taken
  from the GeoJSON conversions published in the upstream repository:
  https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector/tree/v5.1.2/geojson
  Regeneration is reproducible with tools/build-regions.mjs.

Any geometry later imported from another source gets its own directory, its
own paragraph here and its own attribution in the interface. Imported
geometry is never merged into record files (see ARCHITECTURE.md).
